    "image_path": "images/slide_03.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "给读者的话\n\n黄色啦和黑色啦是一对好朋友。他俩待在一起时，颜色特别鲜明，引人注意。他们有时候也淘气，吓唬吓唬小动物。其实他们的心肠很好，看见小动物们朝悬崖走去时，他们就赶紧变成一个“危险！”标志，使小动物们脱离危险。\n\n这两个好朋友变过许多标志呢。你仔细观察过吗？在马路旁、铁路道口、急转弯处、建筑工地、高压线附近……都有他们的身影，热心地为大家服务，提醒人们注意安全，也许他们救过好多人的命呢！",
    "page_text_en": "A Message to the Reader\n\nYellow La and Black La are good friends. When they are together, their colors are especially bright and eye-catching. Sometimes they are mischievous and scare small animals. But actually, they have kind hearts. When they see small animals heading toward a cliff, they quickly turn into a \"Danger!\" sign to help the animals escape danger.\n\nThese two good friends have transformed into many different signs. Have you ever paid close attention? Near roads, railway crossings, sharp turns, construction sites, and near high-voltage wires... you can find their presence, serving everyone with enthusiasm, reminding people to be safe. Perhaps they have saved many lives!",
    "summary_zh": "本页是绘本《两个好朋友》的导读页，介绍了主角黄色啦和黑色啦是能变成各种安全警示标志的好朋友，他们虽然有时淘气，但心地善良，热心帮助他人注意安全。"
  },
