    "image_path": "images/slide_27.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "1. 取一只纸杯A，如图剪出一个圆洞。（图1-2）\n2. 套入一个纸杯B，用铅笔沿这个圆洞画出轮廓线。（图3-4）\n3. 在纸杯B上画好三个圆。（图5）\n4. 将纸杯A涂上黑色。（图6-7）\n5. 在纸杯B的三个圆形里依次涂上红、黄、绿三种颜色。（图8-9）\n6. 把纸杯B套入纸杯A，玩游戏喽：红灯停、黄灯减速、绿灯行。（图10-12）",
    "page_text_en": "1. Take a paper cup A, and cut out a round hole as shown in the figure. (Figures 1-2)\n2. Insert a paper cup B, and use a pencil to draw the outline along the round hole. (Figures 3-4)\n3. Draw three circles on paper cup B. (Figure 5)\n4. Paint paper cup A black. (Figures 6-7)\n5. Paint the three circles on paper cup B with red, yellow, and green colors in order. (Figures 8-9)\n6. Insert paper cup B into paper cup A, and play the game: red light stop, yellow light slow down, green light go. (Figures 10-12)",
    "summary_zh": "本页展示了制作红绿灯手工模型的最后六个步骤，包括剪洞、套杯、画圆、涂色和组装，并引导孩子通过‘红灯停、黄灯减速、绿灯行’的游戏规则进行互动。"
